This file holds the public GPG key the charts in this repository are signed
with. Import it and export a keyring Helm can read:

    curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lockdep/helm-charts/main/KEYS | gpg --import
    gpg --export helm@stackradar.io > /tmp/lockdep-keyring.gpg
    helm pull oci://ghcr.io/lockdep/helm-charts/stackradar --prov --verify --keyring /tmp/lockdep-keyring.gpg

No key has been generated yet. Before the first release: `gpg --full-generate-key` (RSA 4096, uid "StackRadar Helm
<helm@stackradar.io>"), paste `gpg --armor --export helm@stackradar.io`
below, and store the private key and passphrase as the GPG_PRIVATE_KEY and
GPG_PASSPHRASE secrets and GPG_KEY_NAME variable of the `release`
environment in this repository's settings (.github/workflows/helm-release.yml).
